# What fontconfig resolves each common Word font name to in moalhaddar/docx-to-pdf's image, measured with fc-match
# there. The image must resolve each to the same family (image/test.sh, `fc-match -f '%{family}'`), on both
# architectures, with every extra font package installed. Brown Std and GE Dinar Two are left out: they are
# commercial, their licences forbid redistribution, so the image does not carry them and substitutes them by design.
# name<TAB>family
Calibri	Carlito
Calibri Light	DejaVu Sans
Cambria	Caladea
Cambria Math	DejaVu Math TeX Gyre
Aptos	DejaVu Sans
Aptos Display	DejaVu Sans
Aptos Narrow	DejaVu Sans
Aptos Serif	DejaVu Sans
Aptos Mono	DejaVu Sans
Times New Roman	Liberation Serif
Times	Liberation Serif
Arial	Liberation Sans
Helvetica	Liberation Sans
Arial Narrow	Liberation Sans Narrow
Courier New	Liberation Mono
Symbol	OpenSymbol
Consolas	DejaVu Sans Mono
Georgia	DejaVu Serif
Garamond	DejaVu Serif
Palatino Linotype	DejaVu Serif
SimSun	DejaVu Serif
Wingdings	DejaVu Sans
Verdana	DejaVu Sans
Tahoma	DejaVu Sans
Trebuchet MS	DejaVu Sans
Century Gothic	DejaVu Sans
Book Antiqua	DejaVu Sans
Segoe UI	DejaVu Sans
Comic Sans MS	DejaVu Sans
Impact	DejaVu Sans
Lucida Console	DejaVu Sans
Arial Black	DejaVu Sans
Lucida Sans Unicode	DejaVu Sans
Arial Unicode MS	DejaVu Sans
Simplified Arabic	DejaVu Sans
MS Mincho	DejaVu Sans
MS Gothic	DejaVu Sans
Yu Gothic	DejaVu Sans
Malgun Gothic	DejaVu Sans
Microsoft YaHei	DejaVu Sans
Droid Arabic Kufi	Droid Arabic Kufi
Cantarell	Cantarell
